{
  "info": {
    "name": "SG Backend — Sprint 0 Complete",
    "description": "Sprint 0: All broken bugs fixed. All endpoints that were ⚠️/❌ are now ✅. Also includes 4 newly mounted route groups.\n\nFixes applied:\n1. auth.js — jwt.verify() wrapped in try-catch (returns 401 JSON on bad token)\n2. authController — JWT secret fallback removed; KYC sentinel data removed from register\n3. adminPaymentProviderRoutes — verifyuser added before requireRole\n4. server.js — startup env var validation (ACCESS_TOKEN_SECRET_KEY, REFRESH_TOKEN_SECRET_KEY, DATABASE_URL)\n5. driverLocationController — pool import added (getNearbyDrivers now works)\n6. PaymentProviderService — pool import added\n7. Constant.js — REQUEST_EXPIRY_MINUTES: 5 and PLATFORM_FEE_PERCENTAGE: 20 added\n8. PaymentService — getPaymentDetails(paymentId, userId) implemented\n9. PaymentMethodService — getUserPaymentMethods() and deletePaymentMethod() re-implemented\n10. driverApplicationController — driverId scoping bug fixed (const shadow removed)\n11. adminRideController — return(err) → next(err) in createRide catch\n12. paymentRoutes — duplicate GET /:paymentId removed\n13. safetyCommentRoutes — requireRole import fixed to requireRole.js\n14. app.js — driverProfileRoutes, driverVerificationRoutes, adminBadgeRoutes, safetyCommentRoutes mounted",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_postman_id": "sg-sprint-0-2026-06-24"
  },
